Generate UUIDs, or read what one holds (RFC 9562)

Usage: tw uuid <COMMAND>

Commands:
  generate  Generate UUIDs: random (v4), time-ordered (v7), from a name (v3, v5), or v1, v6
  inspect   What a UUID holds: its version, variant and time, and its other forms
  help      Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help
